message: "If you use this theoretical framework or the synthetic verification code, cite it as a theoretical methods preprint and do not treat its simulations as biological validation."
title: "Heteroplasmy Phase Control: Threshold-Aware Mitophagy Scheduling as a Stochastic Control Problem for Mitochondrial Aging"
authors:
  - family-names: Debnath
    given-names: Devanik
    affiliation: "Department of Electronics and Communication Engineering, National Institute of Technology Agartala, India"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-10"
