license: "MIT"
keywords:
  - mitochondrial DNA heteroplasmy
  - mitophagy
  - stochastic control
  - mitochondrial aging
  - first-passage time
abstract: >-
  A theoretical methods preprint deriving a fixed-dose scheduling theorem for a
  reduced heteroplasmy selection model, with synthetic stochastic audits and
  falsifiable experimental gates. No biological intervention is validated.
